{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Fetch a Session Token","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Perform a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST"},{"text":" request to the following endpoint:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Environment","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Test","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Live","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Headers:","type":"text"}]}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Content-Type: application\/json"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Body:","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"syntax":"json"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The required ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roles"},{"text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Import the SDK","level":2,"anchor":"Import-the-SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProvisioningSession"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not import ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Implement a Token Provider","level":2,"anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Device Testing Requirements","level":2,"anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Release build on a physical device","type":"text"}]},{"text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Next Steps","level":2,"anchor":"Next-Steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/SessionsProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/OfflineProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfac